he **NIST Cybersecurity Framework** provides a strong foundation in defensive practices.\n*   **Patch Management:** Learning how to identify, prioritize, and apply software updates is one of the most effective ways to protect systems from known exploits.\n\nFor more information on secure coding and system hardening, you can search for resources provided by cybersecurity organizations like SANS Institute or OWASP.","extra_content":{"google":{"thought_signature":""}},"role":"assistant"}}],"created":1779366046,"id":"kvgOasCVMb-N7M8P_dXWqQQ","model":"gemini-3-flash-preview","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":447,"prompt_tokens":22,"total_tokens":676}}
