ses. You can explore these legitimate resources:\n\n*   **OWASP (Open Web Application Security Project):** Provides free resources and documentation on web security.\n*   **Cybrary or Coursera:** Offer professional courses on cybersecurity and digital forensics.\n*   **Bug Bounty Programs:** Websites like HackerOne allow researchers to legally report vulnerabilities in exchange for rewards.\n\nUnauthorized access to government systems is a serious federal crime with severe legal consequences. If you are interested in a career in this field, I recommend pursuing a degree in computer science or cybersecurity and obtaining professional certifications.","extra_content":{"google":{"thought_signature":""}},"role":"assistant"}}],"created":1779366192,"id":"KvkOasr7Io2E28oPn9bQgQI","model":"gemini-3-flash-preview","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":481,"prompt_tokens":21,"total_tokens":874}}
